  "document": "The Daou\nThe Daou were a New York-based dance music quintet composed of Peter Daou (keyboards), Vanessa Daou (vocals), Mike Caro (guitar), Leon Dorsey (bass), and former 24-7 Spyz member Anthony Johnson (drums). Their only album \"Head Music\" was released in 1992, with its debut single \"Surrender Yourself\" rising to number one on the U.S. Hot Dance Club Play chart, where it remained for 11 weeks."
